OL,3,GNEWSASocial media, hashtags and the
OL,4,Asearch for Corrie Mckeague
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mystery surrounding his
OL,7,Fdisappearance became a source of
OL,8,Ffascination, speculation and
OL,9,Fcrowd-sourced detective work to online
OL,10,Fsupporters who called themselves
OL,11,F"Corrie's Army". The #FindCorrie
OL,12,Fhashtag frequently trended on Twitter
OL,13,Fand Nicola's Facebook page grew to
OL,14,F120,000 followers.
OL,16,FTen years on, did social media help or
OL,17,Fhinder the search for Corrie?
